$MDESC::Type = "Tribes Arena";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Tribes Arena" @
	"\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Tombaugh V" @
	"\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Hazy" @
	"\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @
	"\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	"\n<f1>Converter: <f0>Rasia planetstarsiege.com/TheDen" @
	"\n\n<f1>Briefing: <f0> Two bases, two teams, separated by a large chasm.  A lengthy bridge joins the two.  The last team standing wins.  Flags don't mean jack here, only you, your disc launcher, and your teammates.  Those who work together will stand, those who do not, will be forgotten.";